    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 138 of the laws of 1998 amending the navigation law and the state finance law relating to the operation of personal watercraft and specialty prop-craft, in relation to extending the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S5372",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5372-2011",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
